-- LocalScript -> put in StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts, name it "AimClient"
-- Client-only ESP, aimbot and triggerbot with a movable control panel.
-- No server script or RemoteEvent needed.
-- The panel has three sections (ESP, Aimbot, Triggerbot). Click a section's name to
-- open its settings, and use the switch on its right to turn it on or off.
-- ESP has separate switches for Names and Distance, plus a color picker.
-- Aimbot: hold the aim key and the camera turns toward the player closest to your cursor.
-- Triggerbot: clicks automatically while an enemy is under your cursor (wall check + delay).
-- Drag the title bar to move the panel. "Presets" opens Default / Hard / Soft.
-- Problems are printed to the Output/dev console (F9) and shown as an on-screen notification.

local Players = game:GetService("Players")
local RunService = game:GetService("RunService")
local UserInputService = game:GetService("UserInputService")
local CollectionService = game:GetService("CollectionService")
local StarterGui = game:GetService("StarterGui")
